    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guitar hero meets Galactica</h2><br>Pew Pew Rocket is a space shooter but with a unique twist, Instead of shooting lasers and plasma's it mixes together a guitar hero type beat system in which to destroy your enemy! Instead of explosions its instead beautiful fireworks!<br><br>The game features 3 difficulties to play through, 3 ships and a sick soundtrack for each level.<br><br>You play by shooting out a Directional key, or X,A,Y,B on the Xbox Controller, and you will need to hit the correct key as it passes over an enemy ship.<br>You get scored by how accurate you are for each shot so try to get those perfects as much as you can!<br><br>The beautiful effects, fast, unique game play and awesome soundtrack will get you hooked!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guitar hero meets Galactica</h2><br>Pew Pew Rocket is a space shooter but with a unique twist, Instead of shooting lasers and plasma's it mixes together a guitar hero type beat system in which to destroy your enemy! Instead of explosions its instead beautiful fireworks!<br><br>The game features 3 difficulties to play through, 3 ships and a sick soundtrack for each level.<br><br>You play by shooting out a Directional key, or X,A,Y,B on the Xbox Controller, and you will need to hit the correct key as it passes over an enemy ship.<br>You get scored by how accurate you are for each shot so try to get those perfects as much as you can!<br><br>The beautiful effects, fast, unique game play and awesome soundtrack will get you hooked!",
